  "question": {
    "text": "Let the curve <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> satisfies the equation <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math> and passes through the point&nbsp;<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math> then the value of <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is&nbsp;"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>3</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>2</mn></math>",
